# ── AWS SNS DLT (MANDATORY for SMS delivery in India) ──────────────────────
# TRAI mandates DLT registration for all SMS senders in India.
# Without these, SNS returns HTTP 200 but Indian carriers silently drop the SMS.
# Steps:
#   1. Register at https://www.ucc.gov.in (or Airtel/Jio/Vi DLT portal)
#   2. Get your Entity ID and Template ID after approval
#   3. Fill in the values below
